# SkillOpt state directory.
# Generated at runtime:
#   scores.json    hash(CLAUDE.md) -> selection score (cache C)
#   rejected.jsonl epoch-local rejected-edit buffer (B)
#   meta.md        optimizer-side meta skill (teacher only, never deployed)
#   evidence.jsonl rolling session evidence (forward-pass rollouts)
#   proposal.md    last proposed patch (propose-only mode)
#   history.jsonl  accepted/rejected decision log
